bs_source_bit=⊢ ∀bs i. i < dimindex (:α) ∧ i < LENGTH bs ⇒ (bits_to_word bs ' i ⇔ bs❲i❳)
bs_full_miss=⊢ ∀bs i. i < dimindex (:α) ∧ LENGTH bs ≤ i ⇒ ¬bits_to_word bs ' i
bs_full_snoc=⊢ ∀bs b. bits_to_word (SNOC b bs) = (if b then 1w else 0w) ≪ LENGTH bs ‖ bits_to_word bs
